WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.869
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.203
How's everybody doing tonight?
That's so good to hear.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.805
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:08.908
Incoming New York governor
Kathy Hochul

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.676
appeared this morning
on the "Today" show,

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:12.645
and so did Cuomo.

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.047
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:15.448
The White House
announced yesterday

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.149
that the Biden
administration will send

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:21.087
more than 800,000 doses of
the Pfizer coronavirus vaccine

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:23.422
to Caribbean countries.
Not on purpose --

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:27.159
Ron DeSantis just keeps
chucking 'em into the ocean.

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:29.696
Officials in Philadelphia
announced a new mask mandate

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.098
yesterday due to rising
coronavirus cases,

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.834
which is going to be tricky
for any Philly residents

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:38.771
who have no discernible mouth
and only one huge nostril.

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:40.106
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.174
Amazon opened a new
billion-dollar air hub

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:43.476
in Kentucky yesterday

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.579
that will serve as the central
location for Amazon Air.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.514
Coincidentally, Amazon Air

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:51.918
is also what makes up
most of their packages.

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:55.454
In a new interview -- a new
interview, Rudy Giuliani said

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:57.690
that disgraced New York governor
Andrew Cuomo

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.293
will "resurrect himself
in some way."

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.028
And I'd take Rudy's word for it,

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:06.232
because it looks like
he was just resurrected.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.301
Rock band Maroon 5
announced yesterday

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:10.770
that attendees
of their upcoming Ohio concert

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.538
must show proof of vaccination

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:14.941
or a recent negative
coronavirus test,

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:17.643
because they need to make sure
nothing bad happens to Maroon 4.

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.078
I mean, they're
not for everyone,

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:21.247
but some people love Maroon 3
and want to keep them safe.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.682
There's just something special
about Maroon 2.

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:26.719
Oh, my God! Run, Adam!

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:28.654
Today was National
Middle Child Day,

00:01:28.654 --> 00:01:30.489
but don't worry if you forgot.

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:31.758
Everyone did.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:34.660
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:37.029
Astronauts aboard
the International Space Station

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:39.699
recently held their own version
of the Olympics,

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:42.502
and it really spooked
the dressage horse.

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:43.770
[ Laughter ]

